{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\集落全景夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="13">"People have been killed every year for the last 10 years, haven't they?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"The curse-killings, right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"Yes. Those are the people who learned too much being killed."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Learned too much...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="13">"As I said, all </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> wants is to go on quietly here, with no one getting in her way. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">Which means </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> sees anyone who threatens her peace as an enemy. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">―anyone who gets close to her, every one of them..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"What the hell... so the curse-killings were just </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> killing people, in the end...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"That's about it. </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> uses the dead to kill her targets."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="13">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">She</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">, in her heart, finds the people of the Arata settlement a nuisance. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">There's no telling what might give her away. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">That's why, for decades, there were times she killed people who hadn't long to live and made it look like suicide. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">She thought she could drive the humans away that way, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">driving off residents rooted in the land isn't so simple."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Don't tell me, </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, you killed someone too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"I was never made to serve. I only woke yesterday. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Chigaya<STYLE ID="13">―to rescue her, </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> and I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">No―should I say </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> rescued her?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">　Before </STYLE>Chigaya<STYLE ID="13"> learned too much, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> called us. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">She</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> doesn't kill people without reason either."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"So... that's how it was..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Even if she doesn't kill without reason...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The curse-killings―that doesn't change the fact that they were selfish murders by </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">She just wants to go on quietly, in peace.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For that alone, she went on killing―nine people.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And not just that; apparently she's killed old people and made it look like suicide, too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There's no way that's forgivable...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But... what is this...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Something's nagging at me...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If that's the case, then </STYLE>Chiga-nee<STYLE ID="1">, back there, was―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山雨宿り.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="13">"Say, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">, </STYLE>Chigaya<STYLE ID="13"> was all right, wasn't she?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Huh?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Oh, yeah, though she threw me on my back out of nowhere..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"I'm sorry. I expect that was so </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> wouldn't catch on."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> said the same thing. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">But won't what </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'re doing get found out? </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s got you serving her, right?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="13">"It's fine for now. </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> is busy regenerating </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Eiichiro's</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> body."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Regenerating his body?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"We're dead, after all, so what we can do is limited. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">Once we've been active for a certain time, our bodies start to rot, so </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> repairs them regularly. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">At those times, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> doesn't notice anything I do."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"What a complicated creature..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="13">"So, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">, the next time we meet, I may be your enemy. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> doesn't forgive anyone who learns </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> exists."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"What!? Then all of us...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> know too! And </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"So that's how it is. The people of the settlement don't seem to know yet, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">I see, so everyone from Motoki-cho knows, and so do my children."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">! Can't you keep it secret!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　So </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> doesn't find out...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"I could... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">but if I do anything unnatural, I'm sure </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">'ll kill every one of you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Kill us... you mean we'd be turned into cherry trees...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"No. Like the curse-killings―no argument, no delay. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">Turning into a cherry tree takes a little time."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"I'm going back after all! I have to tell everyone this!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"But it's dangerous. You finally got away..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> told me to run because I'm no use even if I stay!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　But... I don't want to be the only one who runs!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　I've got a duty to tell everyone what I just heard!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="13">"But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">as I said, the next time we meet, I'll probably be your enemy."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, do what </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> can!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> don't want to see </STYLE>Chiga-nee<STYLE ID="5"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> done in by </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> either, right!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">I don't know what I can do, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"I finally found something I can do!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　I'm sure </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> can too...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="13">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">... don't do anything reckless, all right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">　Be careful of </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> especially. </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">He</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> must be somewhere around. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13">By now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">her</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> will should be starting to work again, too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, huh... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Got it! Thanks!"</STYLE><PG>
